{"content_hash": "6494b173def8d0f2", "version_id": 794, "article_id": 80, "level_code": "en_b2", "lang": "en", "level": 4, "level_label": "B2 中高级", "title": "Rokid launches two AI glasses and a ring that reads your health", "title_zh": "乐奇Rokid发布两款AI眼镜和一枚能测健康的戒指", "has_translation": true, "topic": "business", "source": "tmtpost", "source_url": "https://www.tmtpost.com/8183616.html", "image": {"type": "photo", "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/5/5b/COP30_-_Rokid_01.jpg", "provider": "openverse", "credit": "Xuthoria · by-sa 4.0 · via wikimedia", "author": "Xuthoria", "credit_url": "", "source": "Openverse", "source_url": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/w/index.php?curid=179047007", "fallback": {"type": "gradient", "from": "hsl(155, 42%, 62%)", "to": "hsl(193, 46%, 48%)", "label": "BUSINESS", "seed": "f54bcf2dfbf0"}}, "published_date": "2026-10-28", "word_count": 197, "reading_minutes": 1.0, "lead": "Rokid has unveiled two new AI glasses and a smart ring at its Jungle 2026 event. The company says the devices are designed to reduce how often users need to look at their phones.", "lead_zh": "乐奇Rokid在Jungle 2026发布会上推出了两款新的AI眼镜和一枚智能戒指。公司表示，这些产品旨在减少用户盯着手机屏幕的次数。", "preview": "On 27 October 2026, Rokid introduced the Glasses 2, the full-colour Color model and the Ring. The Glasses 2 starts at 3,699 yuan, or 3,199 y", "preview_zh": "2026年10月27日，乐奇Rokid推出了Glasses 2、全彩版Color和Ring戒指。Glasses 2起售价3699元，享受国补后为3199元；Color售价在4999元至5499元之间；Ring售价1699元。", "has_audio": true, "audio": {"id": 777, "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/80/en_b2.mp3", "duration": 92.325, "size_bytes": 554976, "engine": "kokoro", "voice": "af_heart", "word_count": 231, "has_timeline": true, "alternates": [{"voice": "af_bella", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/80/en_b2_af_bella.mp3", "duration": 94.2, "size_bytes": 566208, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 231, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/80/en_b2_af_bella.json"}, {"voice": "am_michael", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/80/en_b2_am_michael.mp3", "duration": 99.7, "size_bytes": 599184, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 231, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/80/en_b2_am_michael.json"}, {"voice": "bf_emma", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/80/en_b2_bf_emma.mp3", "duration": 86.8, "size_bytes": 521712, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 231, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/80/en_b2_bf_emma.json"}, {"voice": "bm_george", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/80/en_b2_bm_george.mp3", "duration": 93.825, "size_bytes": 563904, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 231, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/80/en_b2_bm_george.json"}]}, "detail_url": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/chjam12301-sys/news-etl@42e9725/content/data/versions/794.json", "paragraphs": ["On 27 October 2026, Rokid introduced the Glasses 2, the full-colour Color model and the Ring. The Glasses 2 starts at 3,699 yuan, or 3,199 yuan with a national subsidy, while the Color costs between 4,999 and 5,499 yuan. The Ring is priced at 1,699 yuan.", "The Glasses 2 comes in black and tortoiseshell, and its optical unit is 30% smaller than before. Rokid claims rainbow patterns are down 60% and reflections 70% lower. The battery grows 25% to 263mAh, and a new charging capsule reaches 90% in 30 minutes and can refill the glasses six times.", "AI features cover more situations. The glasses can take meeting notes using sound and first-person images, and they translate calls in 89 languages across WeChat, Feishu and Teams. Accessibility tools help deaf users follow group conversations, while a partnership with JD.com explores visual prompts and obstacle warnings for blind users.", "The Color uses a custom Micro-LED engine and weighs 55 grams, showing pictures, video and navigation. The matching Ring supports swipe and tap gestures for silent input, and it also tracks heart rate, body temperature, blood oxygen and sleep. Rokid says more than 45,000 developers are now on its platform."], "paragraphs_zh": ["2026年10月27日，乐奇Rokid推出了Glasses 2、全彩版Color和Ring戒指。Glasses 2起售价3699元，享受国补后为3199元；Color售价在4999元至5499元之间；Ring售价1699元。", "Glasses 2有黑色和玳瑁色两种配色，光机体积比上一代缩小30%。乐奇称彩虹纹降低60%，反射率降低70%。电池容量提升25%至263mAh，新款充电胶囊30分钟可充至90%，能为眼镜充电六次。", "AI功能覆盖更多场景。眼镜可结合声音和第一视角画面记录会议纪要，并支持微信、飞书和Teams上89种语言的通话翻译。无障碍功能帮助听障用户跟上多人对话，而与京东的合作则为视障用户探索视觉提示和障碍提醒。", "Color采用定制Micro-LED光机，重55克，可显示图片、视频和导航信息。配套的Ring支持滑动和点击手势，实现无声输入，还能监测心率、体温、血氧和睡眠。乐奇表示平台开发者已超过4.5万名。"], "body": "On 27 October 2026, Rokid introduced the Glasses 2, the full-colour Color model and the Ring. The Glasses 2 starts at 3,699 yuan, or 3,199 yuan with a national subsidy, while the Color costs between 4,999 and 5,499 yuan. The Ring is priced at 1,699 yuan.\n\nThe Glasses 2 comes in black and tortoiseshell, and its optical unit is 30% smaller than before. Rokid claims rainbow patterns are down 60% and reflections 70% lower. The battery grows 25% to 263mAh, and a new charging capsule reaches 90% in 30 minutes and can refill the glasses six times.\n\nAI features cover more situations. The glasses can take meeting notes using sound and first-person images, and they translate calls in 89 languages across WeChat, Feishu and Teams. Accessibility tools help deaf users follow group conversations, while a partnership with JD.com explores visual prompts and obstacle warnings for blind users.\n\nThe Color uses a custom Micro-LED engine and weighs 55 grams, showing pictures, video and navigation. The matching Ring supports swipe and tap gestures for silent input, and it also tracks heart rate, body temperature, blood oxygen and sleep. Rokid says more than 45,000 developers are now on its platform.", "body_zh": "2026年10月27日，乐奇Rokid推出了Glasses 2、全彩版Color和Ring戒指。Glasses 2起售价3699元，享受国补后为3199元；Color售价在4999元至5499元之间；Ring售价1699元。\n\nGlasses 2有黑色和玳瑁色两种配色，光机体积比上一代缩小30%。乐奇称彩虹纹降低60%，反射率降低70%。电池容量提升25%至263mAh，新款充电胶囊30分钟可充至90%，能为眼镜充电六次。\n\nAI功能覆盖更多场景。眼镜可结合声音和第一视角画面记录会议纪要，并支持微信、飞书和Teams上89种语言的通话翻译。无障碍功能帮助听障用户跟上多人对话，而与京东的合作则为视障用户探索视觉提示和障碍提醒。\n\nColor采用定制Micro-LED光机，重55克，可显示图片、视频和导航信息。配套的Ring支持滑动和点击手势，实现无声输入，还能监测心率、体温、血氧和睡眠。乐奇表示平台开发者已超过4.5万名。", "text": "On 27 October 2026, Rokid introduced the Glasses 2, the full-colour Color model and the Ring. The Glasses 2 starts at 3,699 yuan, or 3,199 yuan with a national subsidy, while the Color costs between 4,999 and 5,499 yuan. The Ring is priced at 1,699 yuan. The Glasses 2 comes in black and tortoiseshell, and its optical unit is 30% smaller than before. Rokid claims rainbow patterns are down 60% and reflections 70% lower. The battery grows 25% to 263mAh, and a new charging capsule reaches 90% in 30 minutes and can refill the glasses six times. AI features cover more situations. The glasses can take meeting notes using sound and first-person images, and they translate calls in 89 languages across WeChat, Feishu and Teams. Accessibility tools help deaf users follow group conversations, while a partnership with JD.com explores visual prompts and obstacle warnings for blind users. The Color uses a custom Micro-LED engine and weighs 55 grams, showing pictures, video and navigation. The matching Ring supports swipe and tap gestures for silent input, and it also tracks heart rate, body temperature, blood oxygen and sleep. Rokid says more than 45,000 developers are now on its platform.", "vocab": [{"word": "unveil", "pos": "verb", "zh": "发布；揭晓", "note": "常用于新产品或计划首次公开", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "subsidy", "pos": "noun", "zh": "补贴", "note": "national subsidy 指政府补贴", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "optical", "pos": "adj", "zh": "光学的", "note": "optical unit 指光机模组", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "reflection", "pos": "noun", "zh": "反射；反光", "note": "reduce reflection 降低反光", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "capsule", "pos": "noun", "zh": "胶囊；充电仓", "note": "此处指便携充电胶囊", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "accessibility", "pos": "noun", "zh": "无障碍；可及性", "note": "accessibility tools 无障碍功能", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "obstacle", "pos": "noun", "zh": "障碍物", "note": "obstacle warning 障碍提醒", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "gesture", "pos": "noun", "zh": "手势", "note": "swipe and tap gestures 滑动和点击手势", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "track", "pos": "verb", "zh": "监测；追踪", "note": "track heart rate 监测心率", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "partnership", "pos": "noun", "zh": "合作关系", "note": "in partnership with 与……合作", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "developer", "pos": "noun", "zh": "开发者", "note": "platform developer 平台开发者", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "first-person", "pos": "adj", "zh": "第一视角的", "note": "first-person images 第一视角画面", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}], "fetched_at": "2026-10-28T00:40:07.973088", "timeline": [{"i": 0, "w": "On", "s": 0.25, "e": 0.375, "sm": 250, "em": 375, "cs": 0, "ce": 2, "si": 0}, {"i": 1, "w": "27", "s": 0.375, "e": 1.038, "sm": 375, "em": 1037, "cs": 3, "ce": 5, "si": 0}, {"i": 2, "w": "October", "s": 1.038, "e": 1.45, "sm": 1037, "em": 1449, "cs": 6, "ce": 13, "si": 0}, {"i": 3, "w": "2026", "s": 1.45, "e": 2.6, "sm": 1450, "em": 2599, "cs": 14, "ce": 18, "si": 0}, {"i": 4, "w": ",", "s": 2.6, "e": 2.737, "sm": 2600, "em": 2737, "cs": 18, "ce": 19, "si": 0}, {"i": 5, "w": "Rokid", "s": 2.737, "e": 3.175, "sm": 2737, "em": 3175, "cs": 20, "ce": 25, "si": 0}, {"i": 6, "w": "introduced", "s": 3.175, "e": 3.662, "sm": 3175, "em": 3662, "cs": 26, "ce": 36, "si": 0}, {"i": 7, "w": "the", "s": 3.663, "e": 3.75, "sm": 3662, "em": 3749, "cs": 37, "ce": 40, "si": 0}, {"i": 8, "w": "Glasses", "s": 3.75, "e": 4.237, "sm": 3750, "em": 4237, "cs": 41, "ce": 48, "si": 0}, {"i": 9, "w": "2", "s": 4.237, "e": 4.75, "sm": 4237, "em": 4750, "cs